{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01BnZNTTNefUtUd93wvwBbYt","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"answer\\\":\\\"Based on my search of the context filesystem, here's what I found about KAFKA-20307:\\\\n\\\\n## What KAFKA-20307 is About\\\\n\\\\n**KAFKA-20307** is about \\\\\\\"Add Interactive Queries (IQv1) support for headers-aware stores\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\nThe issue addresses a problem where the new headers-aware state stores (`TimestampedKeyValueStoreWithHeaders` and `TimestampedWindowStoreWithHeaders`) could not be queried using the existing Interactive Queries v1 (IQv1) API. The proposed solution adds backward compatibility by:\\\\n\\\\n1. **Store Type Recognition** - Update `QueryableStoreTypes` to accept headers-aware stores\\\\n2. **Automatic Facade Wrapping** - Modify `GlobalStateStoreProvider` and `StreamThreadStateStoreProvider` to wrap headers-aware stores with facades that strip headers/timestamps as needed\\\\n3. **Restoration Support** - Add `StateManagerUtil.converterForStore()` to determine correct restoration format\\\\n4. **Read-Only Decorator** - Add decorator for headers-aware stores to prevent writes during queries\\\\n\\\\nUsers can now query headers-aware stores using existing IQv1 code without modifications.\\\\n\\\\n## Pull Requests Merged to Address It\\\\n\\\\n**PR #21744** was merged on March 16, 2026 at 13:22:47 UTC to address KAFKA-20307. It was authored by `aliehsaeedii` and merged by `frankvicky`, with the merge commit `a2efacd44ef298c5725bf012fcd10259b9d12518`.\\\\n\\\\n**Source files:**\\\\n- `/store/events/2026/03/13/jira-13644922-created-86ff0938.md`\\\\n- `/store/events/2026/03/16/github-api-apache-kafka-pr-21744-merged-8ca266e1.md`\\\",\\\"error\\\":null,\\\"files\\\":[\\\"INDEX.md\\\",\\\"events/2026/03/13/jira-13644922-created-86ff0938.md\\\",\\\"events/2026/03/16/github-api-apache-kafka-pr-21744-merged-8ca266e1.md\\\"],\\\"seconds\\\":11.11,\\\"truncated\\\":false,\\\"turns\\